  "description": "‼️ 𝕎𝔼𝕃ℂ𝕆𝕄𝔼 𝕋𝕆 𝔻𝔼ℙ𝕋ℍ ‼️\n\n════════════════════════\n\n✨️🏆Guildmate of the month🏆✨️\n\n\n💎 RoxFlex 💎\n\n💎 Topaz 💎\n\n💎 LeoMF 💎\n\n════════════════════════\n\nYou will be kicked if you have  1 week of no - very low guild activity.-\n\n════════════════════════\n- 𝙧𝙚𝙦𝙪𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙢𝙚𝙣𝙩𝙨:\n\n🔸️Combat Lvl : 80+ &lt;focus on level 92&gt;\n\n🔸️Participate in raids\n\n🔸️Contribute to challenges\n\n🔸️Deposit to stockpile regularly\n\n🔸️Take part in Conquest assaults\n\n════════════════════════\n- 𝘿𝙞𝙨𝙘𝙤𝙧𝙙 𝙞𝙨 𝙣𝙤𝙩 𝙖 𝙢𝙪𝙨𝙩 𝙗𝙪𝙩 𝙞𝙩 𝙞𝙨 𝙚𝙭𝙩𝙧𝙚𝙢𝙚𝙡𝙮 𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙤𝙢𝙢𝙚𝙣𝙙𝙚𝙙 𝙛𝙤𝙧:\n\n🔹️Raid alerts\n\n🔹️World boss alerts\n\n🔹️Shrine alerts\n\n🔹️Energizing pool alerts\n\n☎️📞Discord link📞☎️:      \n\nhttps://discord.gg/QYKsQnMTJC\n\n════════════════════════\n\n🔥🔥🔥𝗥𝗔𝗜𝗗𝗦🔥🔥🔥\n\n🔸️(𝘾𝙡𝙫𝙡 92 Raids). 21:00 (GMT+0 UK) Every day.:  (ACTIVE ✅️)\n\n🔸️🥚🍫 𝙀𝙫𝙚𝙣𝙩 𝙧𝙖𝙞𝙙: (INACTIVE⛔️)  - SAME TIME AS NORMAL RAIDS, 3 RAIDS BACK TO BACK EVERYDAY INCLUDING WEEKENDS.\n\n𝙀𝙣𝙚𝙧𝙜𝙞𝙯𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙥𝙤𝙤𝙡: (Active✅️)\n\n🤿Pool times: Thursday 10mins before raid\n════════════════════════\n\nOther guilds include\n\n💠 Depth1 (low level assist guild)\n\n💠 Depth Cursed (class locked guild)\n\n🤘𝗛𝗲𝗹𝗽 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗴𝘂𝗶𝗹𝗱 𝗮𝗰𝘁𝗶𝘃𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗲𝘀 𝗿𝗲𝗴𝘂𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗹𝘆🤟\n\n\n𝕶𝖊𝖊𝖕 𝖆𝖈𝖙𝖎𝖛𝖊 𝖆𝖓𝖉 𝖐𝖊𝖊𝖕 𝖌𝖗𝖔𝖜𝖎𝖓𝖌.",
